      "downstream_item_ids": [],
      "controlled_tbd": null,
      "future_condition": "Defer the undefined AI capability to a later discovery phase.",
      "decision_citation": {
        "source_id": "SRC-REALISTIC-CLAR-001",
        "source_name": "stakeholder-clarifications-2026-08-07.md",
        "location": "line:14",
        "quote": "- DEC-2026-08-07-GAP-005: Defer the undefined AI capability to a later discovery phase.",
        "content_hash": "sha256:a10d68b226cf1f4ac48dc1c08ddc6205e137146657db035c3cae5da46dad5300"
      },
      "original_evidence": [
        {
          "source_id": "SRC-REALISTIC-MT-001",
          "source_name": "meeting-transcripts.txt",
          "location": "line:40",
          "quote": "Tom: I don't know, just the whole thing. It feels intelligent. Can we just add AI to our reports? Make them smarter.",
          "content_hash": "sha256:15111349acf5fa92a2f5a33cbbedfc06765e2bb341473d451c49d5123f49dcc8"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "SRC-REALISTIC-MT-001",
          "source_name": "meeting-transcripts.txt",
          "location": "line:42",
          "quote": "Ananya: We'd need to scope this more. What data would the AI analyze? What outputs are we expecting?",
          "content_hash": "sha256:15111349acf5fa92a2f5a33cbbedfc06765e2bb341473d451c49d5123f49dcc8"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "SRC-REALISTIC-MT-001",
          "source_name": "meeting-transcripts.txt",
          "location": "line:44",
          "quote": "Tom: Just figure it out. Everyone has AI now. We need AI too. Let's discuss again next week.",
          "content_hash": "sha256:15111349acf5fa92a2f5a33cbbedfc06765e2bb341473d451c49d5123f49dcc8"
        }
      ],
      "supersession": null,
      "required_prd_citation_label": "DEC-2026-08-07-GAP-005 — Stakeholder Clarification, Vipin, 2026-08-07"
    },
    {
      "decision_id": "DEC-2026-08-07-GAP-006",
      "decision_maker": "Vipin",
      "decision_date": "2026-08-07",
      "decision_text": "Generate XLSX with formula preservation and label the action “Export to Excel”; this supersedes the earlier proposed “Export to CSV” label.",
      "disposition": "included_first_release",
      "effective_decision_id": "DEC-2026-08-07-GAP-006",
      "downstream_item_ids": [
        "FR-011",
        "AC-002",
        "CON-004"
      ],
      "controlled_tbd": null,
      "future_condition": null,
      "decision_citation": {
        "source_id": "SRC-REALISTIC-CLAR-001",
        "source_name": "stakeholder-clarifications-2026-08-07.md",
        "location": "line:15",
        "quote": "- DEC-2026-08-07-GAP-006: Generate XLSX with formula preservation and label the action “Export to Excel”; this supersedes the earlier proposed “Export to CSV” label.",
        "content_hash": "sha256:a10d68b226cf1f4ac48dc1c08ddc6205e137146657db035c3cae5da46dad5300"
      },
      "original_evidence": [
        {
          "source_id": "SRC-REALISTIC-MT-001",
          "source_name": "meeting-transcripts.txt",
          "location": "line:74",
          "quote": "Ananya: Users need to export reports as PDF and CSV. For the PDF export, it must include the company logo at the top of every page. For CSV, it must preserve formulas - so if a cell has a SUM formula, the CSV should export the formula, not just the value.",
          "content_hash": "sha256:15111349acf5fa92a2f5a33cbbedfc06765e2bb341473d451c49d5123f49dcc8"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "SRC-REALISTIC-MT-001",
          "source_name": "meeting-transcripts.txt",
          "location": "line:76",
          "quote": "Dev: That's tricky for CSV. Most CSV implementations only export values.",
          "content_hash": "sha256:15111349acf5fa92a2f5a33cbbedfc06765e2bb341473d451c49d5123f49dcc8"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "SRC-REALISTIC-MT-001",
          "source_name": "meeting-transcripts.txt",
          "location": "line:80",
          "quote": "Dev: Okay, we can do XLSX instead of plain CSV for the formula support.",
          "content_hash": "sha256:15111349acf5fa92a2f5a33cbbedfc06765e2bb341473d451c49d5123f49dcc8"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "SRC-REALISTIC-MT-001",
          "source_name": "meeting-transcripts.txt",
          "location": "line:82",
          "quote": "Ananya: That works. But the user-facing label should still say \"Export to CSV\" since that's what they're used to.",
          "content_hash": "sha256:15111349acf5fa92a2f5a33cbbedfc06765e2bb341473d451c49d5123f49dcc8"
        }
      ],
      "supersession": null,
      "required_prd_citation_label": "DEC-2026-08-07-GAP-006 — Stakeholder Clarification, Vipin, 2026-08-07"
    },
    {
      "decision_id": "DEC-2026-08-07-GAP-007",
      "decision_maker": "Vipin",
      "decision_date": "2026-08-07",
      "decision_text": "Hybrid refresh: 15-minute automatic refresh plus manual refresh of the latest available precomputed warehouse data, a last-updated timestamp, and protection against excessive repeated requests; no direct live-database query.",
      "disposition": "included_first_release",
      "effective_decision_id": "DEC-2026-08-07-GAP-007",
      "downstream_item_ids": [
        "FR-004",
        "FR-009",
        "FR-010",
